  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **One Big Holiday** (1 review): Named by the reviewer as one of two personal favorites from this recording [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **How Can I Know**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [8]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2004-01-21** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 106 min; rated 3/5 by 6 [1]. Said about its sound: Distortion affects one passage on track d01t06, roughly 3:07 to 3:19, because the PA was distorting; Reviewer finds the recording's sound quality very good; Reviewer calls the recording solid and unusually clean for a rock show [1][2][3][4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The PA system was plagued by distortion during the show, and the tape reproduces what the room sounded like [1]\n- Reviewer attended, standing near the front on the left side of the microphone, and found the band's sound enormous [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2004-01-21**: taped by Nick Gregory; transferred by Nick Gregory; source: MG 200s (DIN, 7.5 ft. high, 25 ft back)->MP-2->Oade mod SBM1->D100 [1]",
